B.aPz=new A.k3("dry-bridge","Dry Bridge Market","You are approaching the Dry Bridge. Its stone arches now span a road. When the market is open, look for records and enamel pins on the traders\u2019 tables.",B.XY)
B.XO=new A.bt(41.69813,44.79874)
B.aPA=new A.k3("national-gallery","National Gallery","The National Gallery is close. Its tall arched windows face Rustaveli Avenue. The paths behind the gallery lead into the garden.",B.XO)
B.XM=new A.bt(41.698365,44.79956)
B.aPx=new A.k3("nine-april-garden","9 April Garden","The tree-lined paths ahead belong to the Ninth of April Garden. This is the upper part of the old Alexander Garden, just behind the National Gallery.",B.XM)
B.XT=new A.bt(41.70085,44.79584)
B.aPv=new A.k3("opera-house","Tbilisi Opera House","The Opera House is near. From the pavement on Rustaveli Avenue, look for striped arches and ornamental windows above the entrance.",B.XT)
B.XW=new A.bt(41.69779,44.79914)
B.aPu=new A.k3("kashveti","Kashveti Church","Kashveti Church sits below the level of the avenue. When you reach the forecourt, pause to look at the carvings in its pale stone fa\xe7ade.",B.XW)
B.XV=new A.bt(41.69581,44.80645)
B.aPB=new A.k3("gabriadze-clock","Gabriadze Clock Tower","A leaning stack of blocks beside the puppet theatre supports an ornate clock. Look up from the pedestrian street when you reach the tower.",B.XV)
B.XP=new A.bt(41.69553,44.80653)
B.aPt=new A.k3("anchiskhati","Anchiskhati Basilica","The low stone basilica near the puppet theatre is tucked below the surrounding street. Its exterior is visible from the approach, even during a service.",B.XP)
B.XX=new A.bt(41.69298,44.80798)
B.aPw=new A.k3("peace-bridge","Bridge of Peace","At the pedestrian entrance to the Bridge of Peace, look along the curved glass canopy. From the middle of the span, you can see both riverbanks.",B.XX)
B.XQ=new A.bt(41.68802,44.81061)
B.aPC=new A.k3("bath-domes","Abanotubani bath domes","As you enter the bath district, look for low brick domes rising beside the pedestrian paths. The bath rooms lie beneath these rounded roofs.",B.XQ)
B.XZ=new A.bt(41.68754,44.8107)
B.aPy=new A.k3("orbeliani-bath","Orbeliani Baths","The blue tiled fa\xe7ade near the bath domes belongs to the Orbeliani Baths. Look at the patterns around the tall central arch when you reach the forecourt.",B.XZ)
